  "body_text": "本周日常测试推荐如下，\n埃塞\nGarse 日晒 - 继续推，最近的曲线特别适合它\nA\nricha\n水洗 -\n来一个甜\n赋异禀的吧\nGotiti日晒 - 蓝莓\n哥斯达黎加\n贝多芬 - 感觉就是水洗版的莫扎特\n哥伦比亚\n狂风 - 曲线调整了，发酵感没有那么重了\n天堂92 瑰夏\n- 订阅发完即上架\n，\n水蜜桃，有时候还会有樱桃酒的感觉\n肯尼亚\n加图博雅 - 继续狂推\n加恰莎 -\n开始出彩咯\n云南\n蔓飞龙超级日晒 新产季， 棒棒哒！",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          本周日常测试推荐如下，\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           埃塞\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Garse 日晒 - 继续推，最近的曲线特别适合它\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            A\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            richa\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            水洗 -\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            来一个甜\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            赋异禀的吧\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Gotiti日晒 - 蓝莓\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           哥斯达黎加\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            贝多芬 - 感觉就是水洗版的莫扎特\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           哥伦比亚\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            狂风 - 曲线调整了，发酵感没有那么重了\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            天堂92 瑰夏\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            - 订阅发完即上架\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            ，\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            水蜜桃，有时候还会有樱桃酒的感觉\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           肯尼亚\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            加图博雅 - 继续狂推\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            加恰莎 -\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            开始出彩咯\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           云南\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            蔓飞龙超级日晒 新产季， 棒棒哒！\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Tt78AlV1Oout4VK9TgBp3uZCYKnV3CkpNmibebn5N4PqvjRwUgw9acedEuflWxm1ceRia673DYtH5A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
